g","kind":"binding","statement":"Within the handler, current_user is the principal value used by the authorization check; the task premise supplies its authenticated active superuser identity at entry, while this crop does not establish the upstream CurrentUser dependency binding.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":49,"endLine":49}]},{"id":"f-resource-binding","kind":"binding","statement":"The handler binds the requested id to an item by retrieving Item with session.get.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":53,"endLine":53}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"The strongest visible authorization control denies access only when the caller is not a superuser and the item owner differs from the caller; a superuser therefore bypasses this denial.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":56,"endLine":57}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"After the authorization check, the handler returns the retrieved item.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":56,"endLine":58}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"The source-visible allow condition is that the caller is a superuser, which makes the negated superuser term false even when ownership differs.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-dcbab1685696c702","startLine":56,"endLine":57}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":3074,"output":791,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":37015.5332,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T19:12:51.755Z"}}
